Hey, Alec, hey everyone, welcome back to Arts Educators Save the World, a podcast where successful artists and their mentors talk about the impact that arts education has had on both of their lives.
嘿，亚历克，大家好，欢迎回到艺术教育者拯救世界，这是一个播客，成功的艺术家和他们的导师谈论艺术教育对他们生活的影响。

