After graduation, Craig and his writing partner, Carter Bays, went on to write for the late show at David Letterman and then wrote for the half hour shows, Oliver Bean and American Dad and others before eventually creating How I Met Your Mother, which ran for, correct me if I'm wrong, 208 episodes on CBS from 2005 to 2014.
