And by the way, everything I'm gonna say about Rob and mentorship and learning to be a show winner, I know that Carter would second all of it, especially the loving Rob Greenberg parts.
顺便说一句，我要说的关于罗布、指导和学习成为节目获胜者的一切，我知道卡特会支持所有这些，尤其是可爱的罗布·格林伯格部分。

